# Website and browser app — hosted separately, not part of this repo
website/
stegstr-website.zip

# The bundled CLI is committed on purpose: the contest gauntlet builds entries
# in a container with no network, so `npm install` cannot run there. The bundle
# has no runtime dependencies, so `node dist-cli/stegstr.mjs` works from a bare
# clone. Sample stego images are committed for the same reason.

